    'pending.replace': { zh: '「{career}」目前不在地图上，会替换好感度最低的「{old}」（好感度 {p}%）。「{old}」的进度会保存，之后可以在职业搜索里换回来。', en: '"{career}" is not on the map: it takes the place of "{old}" (affinity {p}%), the lowest. The progress of "{old}" is saved and you can switch back from the career search.', ms: '"{career}" tiada di peta: ia mengambil tempat "{old}" (keakraban {p}%), yang paling rendah. Kemajuan "{old}" disimpan dan anda boleh menukar semula melalui carian kerjaya.' },
